cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "이 코드를 사용하는 경우 아래 논문을 인용해 주십시오. / If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Horizontal scanning lidar analysis code — MATLAB and Python (PKNU Atmospheric Remote Sensing Laboratory)"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and Python code to retrieve the extinction coefficient, Angstrom
  exponent and depolarization ratio from horizontally scanning aerosol lidar
  observations, using the multi-section reference value method of
  Shin et al. (2024). Released for the KOSAE 2026 training session.
authors:
  - family-names: Shin
    given-names: Juseon
    affiliation: "Atmospheric Remote Sensing Laboratory, Pukyong National University"
  - family-names: Noh
    given-names: Youngmin
    affiliation: "Atmospheric Remote Sensing Laboratory, Pukyong National University"

keywords:
  - lidar
  - aerosol
  - extinction coefficient
  - Angstrom exponent
  - depolarization ratio
  - Klett inversion
